# Test screenshots (headless CDP captures default to the OS temp dir; never commit
# stray ones). The repository root holds NO images: portal assets live in assets/,
# wireframe captures beside their study in docs/wireframes/<study>/screenshots/.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

# Recherche-Rohmaterial (BBL-PDFs, abgerufene Katasterdaten, Wegwerf-Sonden).
